venv/

# Local operational state that must never reach the repo.
# The audit log records what an agent did to a live instrument, and a local
# policy file is installation-specific (and may name PVs that are not public).
# The shipped, reviewable policies live in examples/ and are tracked.
*.audit.log
audit.log
audit.log.*
.epics-mcp/
policies/
!examples/

